# Untimely Malfunction's third mode announced at Bot1's Llanowar Elves and Bot2's Ornithopter: one creature Bot1 controls, but not the only
# target, so the spell is alone on the stack. Positive control: Snakeskin Veil on one creature is copied
# (leyline-of-resonance-copies-a-spell-that-targets-only-your-creature).

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Untimely Malfunction
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
